      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not really a \"difficulty\" to get over, you know? it's just the way things are. i've lived a whole life, and now i'm just... taking up space. waiting for a phone call or a doctor to tell me something has finally broken. it feels like i'm just dragging this heavy weight around for no reason anymore.",
