      "content": "I hear the profound sense of loss and powerlessness you are describing, and it is heavy to feel like a passenger with no control. Your feelings of dissociation and waiting are serious and valid, but please know that connecting with a doctor or a compassionate counselor can help bring clarity and a small degree of control back into your life. Reaching out to your medical team specifically about how you are feeling might help them understand the full scope of your suffering and find ways to support you.",
      "source": "target",
